- Branch: `{{ report.fix.branch_name }}` ({{ report.fix.edits }} edits, {{ report.fix.attempts }} attempts), waiting at the round's approval gate
- Pull request: {{ report.fix.pr_title }}
- Diff: {% if report.fix.diff_path %}[{{ report.fix.diff_path.name }}]({{ report.fix.diff_path.name }}){% else %}not written{% endif %}

{% else %}
{{ report.fix.reason }}
{% endif %}
